From 58b0a4eb94672aeccacba04b1971025fbe43ea5e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 19:11:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Restore hero scroll motion and fix marquee with local
 project images

The previous marquee and hero tweak regressed the experience: MotionSites
assets stopped serving, headline copy sat at the hero bottom, and Lenis scroll
sync no longer drove the works strip. This restores rising headline transforms,
reverts Lenis to a stable RAF loop, combines CSS marquee motion with scroll
parallax, and serves work thumbnails from public assets.
